    {
      "id": 476726,
      "username": "Rehan_Ansari",
      "name": "Rehan Ansari",
      "created_at": "2025-08-08T03:26:15.948Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When you run bench build, new asset files are created. You need to ensure these files have the correct permissions; otherwise, things (like the login page) might break again.</p>\n<p>To avoid setting permissions manually each time, you can set the umask value to 0022. This ensures that whenever bench build creates new asset files, they will automatically have the required permissions.</p>",
